msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"*sigh* I've always wanted to try a glass of goya juice from here... Guess "
"that's not happening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"This shop's been closed, like... forever, hasn't it? I wonder why? It's in "
"the perfect spot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Oh, my grandpa told me about it before. He said their juice\r\n"
"was so healthy that it could heal any sickness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Whoa... How come it closed, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Maybe this <Color:7>Mythical Goya Juice<Color:Default> was so incredibly "
"harsh on the tongue that nobody could drink it. After all, it is goya we're "
"talking about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Did you know that goya's good stir-fried if you add a little mayonnaise? "
"That cancels out the bitter taste."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Are you nuts? The whole point of eating goya is because it's so bitter! "
"That's why it's called bitter melon!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Anyway, enough with all this goya gobbledygook. This place is gone for good,"
" so let's just grab some goya burgers instead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "(Mythical Goya Juice, huh... Wonder if it's any good.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Is anybody there!? I wanna get some goya juice!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"(Looks like that kid wants to try some of that Mythical Goya Juice himself.)"
msgstr ""

